OL,3,GNorth East
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FCloud will
OL,6,Fthicken from the south during the
OL,7,Fevening with some showers breaking
OL,8,Fout. These will give way to some
OL,9,Fheavier and more persistent outbreaks
OL,10,Fof rain overnight. A warm and humid
OL,11,Fnight.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTuesday:FA cloudy start with some
OL,14,Flingering patchy rain. Skies will
OL,15,Fbrighten through the morning,
OL,16,Fespecially in the east, though a few
OL,17,Fshowers could break out during the
OL,18,Fday. Warm.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
