OL,3,GNorth East
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:
OL,6,FWednesday will be cooler and breezy
OL,7,Fwith sunshine and scattered showers.
OL,8,FPerhaps more persistent rain later.
OL,9,FBecoming drier and less breezy to end
OL,10,Fthe week with some sunshine, though
OL,11,Ffresher.
